    "html": "<p>An object with mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> falls through the air with a terminal speed <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span> for a short time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the work done on the air by the falling object during this time? <br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mgvt\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"mgt\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mgv}{t}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{mv}{t}\"></span></li></ol>"
